{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42032","headline":"海上春夕旅怀寄左偃 · 李中","name":"海上春夕旅怀寄左偃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳过清明絮乱飞，感时怀旧思凄凄。\n月生楼阁云初散，家在汀洲梦去迷。\n发白每慙清监啓，酒醒长怯子规啼。\n北山高卧风骚客，安得同吟复杖藜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}